{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05543","headline":"寄张徵古 · 沈如筠","name":"寄张徵古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂历远山意，微冥半空碧。\n绿萝无冬春，彩云竟朝夕。\n张子海内奇，久爲岩中客。\n圣君当梦想，安得老松石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈如筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}